msgstr "LA RUTINA SETMANAL"

msgid "The same task, every week"
msgstr "La mateixa tasca, cada setmana"

msgid ""
"Someone exports a report, reformats it, pastes it somewhere else — every "
"Monday. Predictable, manual, and easy to get wrong."
msgstr ""
"Algú exporta un informe, el reformata, l'enganxa en un altre lloc — cada "
"dilluns. Previsible, manual i fàcil d'equivocar-se."

msgid "DATA BY HAND"
msgstr "DADES A MÀ"

msgid "Data moves manually"
msgstr "Les dades es mouen manualment"

msgid ""
"Information is re-typed between systems that don't talk to each other. It's "
"slow, and one typo quietly breaks things downstream."
msgstr ""
"La informació es torna a escriure entre sistemes que no es comuniquen. És "
"lent, i una errada tipogràfica trenca coses silenciosament."

msgid "CURIOUS ABOUT AI"
msgstr "CURIÓS SOBRE LA IA"

msgid "AI, but make it real"
msgstr "IA, però que sigui real"

msgid ""
"You keep hearing about AI and wonder what's actually useful for your "
"business — without the hype or a six-figure platform."
msgstr ""
"Continues sentint parlar d'IA i et preguntes què és realment útil per al teu"
" negoci — sense el hype ni una plataforma de sis xifres."

msgid "Less busywork, more done —"
msgstr "Menys feina improductiva, més fet —"

msgid "and no black boxes."
msgstr "i sense caixes negres."

msgid ""
"We don't hand you a platform and disappear. We identify what's worth "
"automating, build it, document it, and make sure you own it."
msgstr ""
"No et lliurem una plataforma i desapareixem. Identifiquem el que val la pena"
" automatitzar, ho construïm, documentem i ens assegurem que sigui teu."

msgid "The right things automated"
msgstr "Les coses correctes automatitzades"

msgid "We identify what's worth it; not everything should be."
msgstr "Identifiquem el que val la pena; no tot hauria d'automatitzar-se."

msgid "Tools that finally connect"
msgstr "Eines que finalment es connecten"

msgid "Data flows between your systems automatically."
msgstr "Les dades flueixen entre els teus sistemes automàticament."

msgid "AI where it earns its place"
msgstr "IA on es guanya el seu lloc"

msgid "Drafting, summarizing, classifying — not for show."
msgstr "Redactar, resumir, classificar — no per aparentar."

msgid "Assistants tuned to you"
msgstr "Assistents adaptats a tu"

msgid "Generative-AI helpers shaped around your real processes."
msgstr ""
"Ajudants d'IA generativa dissenyats al voltant dels teus processos reals."

msgid "Hours back, every week"
msgstr "Hores de tornada, cada setmana"

msgid "The repetitive parts, handled while your team does the rest."
msgstr "Les parts repetitives, gestionades mentre el teu equip fa la resta."

msgid "Clear documentation"
msgstr "Documentació clara"

msgid "So it stays maintainable, not a mystery only we understand."
msgstr ""
"Perquè segueixi sent mantenible, no un misteri que sols nosaltres entenem."

msgid "We automate by payback,"
msgstr "Automatitzem per rendibilitat,"

msgid "not by hype."
msgstr "no per hype."

msgid "Spot"
msgstr "Identificar"

msgid ""
"We find the tasks that are frequent, manual and error-prone — the ones "
"actually worth automating."
msgstr ""
"Trobem les tasques que són freqüents, manuals i propenses a errors — les que"
" realment val la pena automatitzar."

msgid ""
"We map the workflow on paper before touching a single tool, so we automate "
"the right thing."
msgstr ""
"Mapegem el flux de treball en paper abans de tocar cap eina, per "
"automatitzar el correcte."

msgid ""
"We connect the tools, add the AI step where it helps, and test it on your "
"real cases."
msgstr ""
"Connectem les eines, afegim el pas d'IA on ajuda i ho testem en els teus "
"casos reals."

msgid "Hand over"
msgstr "Lliurament"

msgid ""
"We document it, train your team, and leave you in control — including how to"
" switch it off."
msgstr ""
"Ho documentem, entrenem el teu equip i et deixem en control — inclòs com "
"apagar-ho."

msgid "Straight answers on AI"
msgstr "Respostes directes sobre IA"

msgid "and automation."
msgstr "i automatització."

msgid "Will AI replace my team?"
msgstr "La IA reemplaçarà el meu equip?"

msgid ""
"No. The point is the opposite: remove the boring, repetitive parts so your "
"team spends time on the work that actually needs a human."
msgstr ""
"No. L'objectiu és el contrari: eliminar les parts avorrides i repetitives "
"perquè el teu equip dediqui temps a la feina que realment necessita un humà."

msgid "Is this just ChatGPT with extra steps?"
msgstr "Això és sols ChatGPT amb passos extra?"

msgid ""
"No. We use LLMs where they genuinely help — drafting, classifying, "
"summarizing — but most automation is connecting tools and removing manual "
"steps. AI is one ingredient, not the whole dish."
msgstr ""
"No. Usem LLMs on realment ajuden, però la majoria de l'automatització és "
"connectar eines i eliminar passos manuals. La IA és un ingredient, no tot el"
" plat."

msgid "How do you decide what to automate?"
msgstr "Com decidiu què automatitzar?"

msgid ""
"We map what's repetitive, high-volume, and error-prone first. Not everything"
" should be automated — we tell you what's worth it and what isn't."
msgstr ""
"Primer mapegem el que és repetitiu, d'alt volum i propens a errors. No tot "
"hauria d'automatitzar-se — et diem el que val la pena i el que no."

msgid "Do you actually know this stuff?"
msgstr "Realment sabeu d'això?"

msgid ""
"Yes. We've built pipelines, connected tools, and shipped automations for "
"real businesses — not just demos. Cengizhan codes it; we both QA it against "
"your actual data."
msgstr ""
"Sí. Hem construït pipelines, connectat eines i enviat automatitzacions per a"
" negocis reals — no sols demos. Cengizhan ho programa; tots dos ho testem "
"amb les teves dades reals."

msgid "What does a \"workflow\" mean in practice?"
msgstr "Què significa un \"flux de treball\" a la pràctica?"

msgid ""
"A chain of steps that runs automatically: a trigger fires (new email, form, "
"schedule), it does things (moves data, calls an API, drafts a reply), and "
"ends with a result you care about — with zero clicks from your team."
msgstr ""
"Una cadena de passos que s'executa automàticament: un disparador s'activa, "
"fa coses i acaba amb un resultat que t'importa — sense cap clic del teu "
"equip."

msgid "Automation is better on"
msgstr "L'automatització és millor sobre"

msgid "a clean foundation."
msgstr "una base neta."

msgid "Clean, trusted data first — then automate on top of it."
msgstr "Primer dades netes i de confiança — després automatitza sobre elles."

msgid "Put an AI assistant on your site to answer, qualify and book."
msgstr ""
"Posa un assistent d'IA al teu lloc per a respondre, qualificar i reservar."

msgid "Teach your team to run and extend the automations themselves."
msgstr ""
"Ensenya al teu equip a executar i ampliar les automatitzacions ells "
"mateixos."

