msgid "6. Sharing Your Data"
msgstr "6. Compartir les Vostres Dades"

msgid ""
"We do not sell your data. We may share it with trusted service providers "
"(e.g., hosting, email delivery) under strict data processing agreements. If "
"data is transferred outside the EEA, we apply appropriate safeguards such as"
" Standard Contractual Clauses."
msgstr ""
